Pihu
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 5 DEAL YUIME
YUIME 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
YUIME 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
YUIME 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
YUIME 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE YUIME YUIME
DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK YUIME YUIME
AND
    SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
    OR
        DEST Rank 1
        SRCSTACK Suit alternate_color
DRAW
PILE ALL DRAW Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL YUIME Empty
